{"real": false, "dur": 41.14, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 3.86, "text": "Wilkins was working on a framework for European languages.", "words": [{"w": "Wilkins", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "was", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "working", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "on", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "framework", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "for", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "European", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "languages.", "s": 3.48}]}, {"start": 4.21, "end": 9.21, "text": "But could the same principles work for a language as different as Chinese?", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 4.21}, {"w": "could", "s": 4.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "same", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "principles", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "work", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "for", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "language", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "as", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "different", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "as", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "Chinese?", "s": 8.83}]}, {"start": 9.56, "end": 13.02, "text": "That’s the question I want to look at today.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "question", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "I", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "want", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "to", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "look", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "at", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "today.", "s": 12.64}]}, {"start": 13.37, "end": 18.76, "text": "Can a platform built for French work for Chinese, a language that’s so different?", "words": [{"w": "Can", "s": 13.37}, {"w": "a", "s": 13.76}, {"w": "platform", "s": 14.14}, {"w": "built", "s": 14.53}, {"w": "for", "s": 14.91}, {"w": "French", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "work", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "for", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 16.45}, {"w": "a", "s": 16.83}, {"w": "language", "s": 17.22}, {"w": "that’s", "s": 17.6}, {"w": "so", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "different?", "s": 18.37}]}, {"start": 19.11, "end": 24.11, "text": "And if so, what can stay the same, and what has to change?", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 19.11}, {"w": "if", "s": 19.49}, {"w": "so,", "s": 19.88}, {"w": "what", "s": 20.26}, {"w": "can", "s": 20.65}, {"w": "stay", "s": 21.03}, {"w": "the", "s": 21.42}, {"w": "same,", "s": 21.8}, {"w": "and", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "what", "s": 22.57}, {"w": "has", "s": 22.95}, {"w": "to", "s": 23.34}, {"w": "change?", "s": 23.72}]}, {"start": 24.46, "end": 29.46, "text": "I’ll start with the French course, then look at what makes Chinese different.", "words": [{"w": "I’ll", "s": 24.46}, {"w": "start", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "with", "s": 25.23}, {"w": "the", "s": 25.61}, {"w": "French", "s": 26.0}, {"w": "course,", "s": 26.38}, {"w": "then", "s": 26.77}, {"w": "look", "s": 27.15}, {"w": "at", "s": 27.53}, {"w": "what", "s": 27.92}, {"w": "makes", "s": 28.3}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 28.69}, {"w": "different.", "s": 29.07}]}, {"start": 29.81, "end": 40.19, "text": "I’ll show you how the same approach can be adapted, using examples from both textbooks, and finish with some steps you can try with your own language.", "words": [{"w": "I’ll", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "show", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "you", "s": 30.58}, {"w": "how", "s": 30.96}, {"w": "the", "s": 31.35}, {"w": "same", "s": 31.73}, {"w": "approach", "s": 32.12}, {"w": "can", "s": 32.5}, {"w": "be", "s": 32.88}, {"w": "adapted,", "s": 33.27}, {"w": "using", "s": 33.65}, {"w": "examples", "s": 34.04}, {"w": "from", "s": 34.42}, {"w": "both", "s": 34.81}, {"w": "textbooks,", "s": 35.19}, {"w": "and", "s": 35.58}, {"w": "finish", "s": 35.96}, {"w": "with", "s": 36.35}, {"w": "some", "s": 36.73}, {"w": "steps", "s": 37.12}, {"w": "you", "s": 37.5}, {"w": "can", "s": 37.88}, {"w": "try", "s": 38.27}, {"w": "with", "s": 38.65}, {"w": "your", "s": 39.04}, {"w": "own", "s": 39.42}, {"w": "language.", "s": 39.81}]}]}